      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "The persisted Anchor, verbatim (contracts.md §6): `@papertree/anchoring`'s `Anchor` v1\nwithout `resolution`. `contracts/anchor/anchor-v1.schema.json` is the same record, written by\nhand; `tests/test_anchor_examples.py` holds this model to every committed example.",
